{"3760450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chaos Rocks", "steam_appid": 3760450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Throw rocks. Score points. Trick the system.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Chaos Rocks</i> is a physics-based puzzle game where every level challenges you to bounce a rock into one of three buckets using gadgets, angles, and sheer stubbornness. Upgrade your tools, automate your points, and master ridiculous trick shots in a stylized, cartoony world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🪨 Simple Goal. Absurd Execution.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/2bd3085e0f0da5a1df53b46193325dd3.poster.avif?t=1761489984\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/2bd3085e0f0da5a1df53b46193325dd3.webm?t=1761489984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/2bd3085e0f0da5a1df53b46193325dd3.mp4?t=1761489984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up a rock. Throw it in a bucket. Easy, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now try doing it across a backyard, city, off a trampoline, banking from a corner board — without tipping a bucket and losing everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚙️ Automate Your Rock Empire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too busy flinging rocks to mine them? Deploy <strong>drones</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine rocks</strong> automatically to earn points over time while you work towards the Victory Bucket.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade drone <strong>speed</strong>, <strong>capacity</strong>, and <strong>battery life</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your automation handle the grind while you focus on your next masterpiece shot</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🪣 Three Buckets. Three Fates.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/a913986e538d75ee9ed678aac39a488b.poster.avif?t=1761489984\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/a913986e538d75ee9ed678aac39a488b.webm?t=1761489984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/a913986e538d75ee9ed678aac39a488b.mp4?t=1761489984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Point Bucket</strong> – Your score machine. Don’t tip it.<br>🔓 Upgrade for bonus points and stability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trick Bucket</strong> – Hidden. Hard to hit. Worth it.<br>🎯 Score big if you land it. No penalty if you fail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Victory Bucket</strong> – Land it to beat the level.<br>🌀 Unlock a <strong>Gravity Well</strong> to bend your shot into it.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🪵 Backboards: Your Best (and Worst) Friend</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/8dc6d50c74b2bf87a53bfb0a6a1e2987.poster.avif?t=1761489984\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/8dc6d50c74b2bf87a53bfb0a6a1e2987.webm?t=1761489984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/8dc6d50c74b2bf87a53bfb0a6a1e2987.mp4?t=1761489984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own throw path using <strong>9 unique backboards made of 2 materials</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wood </strong>slows the rock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trampolines</strong> boost it</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From flat progress boards to tricky 45° corner setups, you'll need the right boards in the right place to land the perfect shot.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔍 Hidden Skulls &amp; Bonus Goals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/cf29bd98cf2c67068f8546793ff921f1.poster.avif?t=1761489984\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/cf29bd98cf2c67068f8546793ff921f1.webm?t=1761489984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/cf29bd98cf2c67068f8546793ff921f1.mp4?t=1761489984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level hides secret <strong>Skull Rocks</strong>.<br>Hit them mid-air for bonus points and bragging rights. You know you want to.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based rock throwing with stylized, cel-shaded visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build elaborate trick shot setups with 9 backboard types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automate your income with fully upgradeable drones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk/reward gameplay with 3 unique bucket types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden collectibles and bonus score routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressively challenging levels with new obstacles and layouts</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Throw rocks. Score points. Trick the system.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Chaos Rocks</i> is a physics-based puzzle game where every level challenges you to bounce a rock into one of three buckets using gadgets, angles, and sheer stubbornness. Upgrade your tools, automate your points, and master ridiculous trick shots in a stylized, cartoony world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🪨 Simple Goal. Absurd Execution.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/2bd3085e0f0da5a1df53b46193325dd3.poster.avif?t=1761489984\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/2bd3085e0f0da5a1df53b46193325dd3.webm?t=1761489984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/2bd3085e0f0da5a1df53b46193325dd3.mp4?t=1761489984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up a rock. Throw it in a bucket. Easy, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now try doing it across a backyard, city, off a trampoline, banking from a corner board — without tipping a bucket and losing everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚙️ Automate Your Rock Empire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too busy flinging rocks to mine them? Deploy <strong>drones</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine rocks</strong> automatically to earn points over time while you work towards the Victory Bucket.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade drone <strong>speed</strong>, <strong>capacity</strong>, and <strong>battery life</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your automation handle the grind while you focus on your next masterpiece shot</p></li></ul><h2 class=