ards made of 2 materials</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wood </strong>slows the rock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trampolines</strong> boost it</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From flat progress boards to tricky 45° corner setups, you'll need the right boards in the right place to land the perfect shot.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔍 Hidden Skulls &amp; Bonus Goals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/cf29bd98cf2c67068f8546793ff921f1.poster.avif?t=1761489984\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/cf29bd98cf2c67068f8546793ff921f1.webm?t=1761489984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/extras/cf29bd98cf2c67068f8546793ff921f1.mp4?t=1761489984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level hides secret <strong>Skull Rocks</strong>.<br>Hit them mid-air for bonus points and bragging rights. You know you want to.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based rock throwing with stylized, cel-shaded visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build elaborate trick shot setups with 9 backboard types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automate your income with fully upgradeable drones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk/reward gameplay with 3 unique bucket types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden collectibles and bonus score routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressively challenging levels with new obstacles and layouts</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Chaos Rocks is a quirky automation and physics-based game where you launch rocks into buckets for points and multipliers. Use backboards, drones, gravity wells, and clever angles to land trick shots, discover secret skulls, and master increasingly tricky levels in a colorful, cel-shaded world.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/34c38baf68e7cb639e45e4c303db27ebcf940832/header.jpg?t=1761489984", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/7cd9e2e6cb17c96ef9f5f15931152d022c5519e1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761489984", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760450/7cd9e2e6cb17c96ef9f5f15931152d022c5519e1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761489984", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-14600K<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 4060 8GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-14700K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 4070 8GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Cntrl Kill Studios"], "publishers": ["Cntrl Kill Studios"], "demos": [{"appid": 3934120, "descriptio